      "reply": {
        "event": 114,
        "text": "Completed: [Download the BC-17 Rev A cutting package](asset:asset-fa8ce52fc3283c99acb7777eed17994d@1).\n\nThe ZIP includes:\n- **BC17-A-cut.svg** — ready-to-cut 1:1 SVG, one continuous straight-segment contour, **62.00 × 27.50 mm**.\n- **PLACEMENT.txt** — rear-view orientation and placement directions.\n- **DIMENSIONAL-CHECK.txt** — tolerance analysis for land coverage, pad-pair/top wire clearance, edge clearance and minimum finished area.\n\nLoad at **100% without mirroring or added offsets**. Place the artwork’s upper-right bounding-box corner **2.00 mm left of the finished module’s right edge and 2.00 mm below its top edge**, with the notch opening toward the pads/top.\n\nThe exported ZIP and SVG scale/contour were checked. This is a dimensional release; actual cutting, tape selection, physical adhesion qualification and installation have not been performed."
